detail:
None of the three docs covers it:
- opening the plane menu without a pointer;
- menu semantics: the mockup has role="menu" but no role="menuitem";
- the chain's keyboard model: Show alone is a lens button or a double-click, with no key;
- card pictures: alt="" and no accessible name on the card;
- focus for the popover editor and the non-modal phone sheets;
- announcements for "Added slider a" and "The curves do not meet here".
